  // The key is the English text, so a missing translation still reads naturally.
  // Keys are case-insensitive and must be unique inside one file. A second spelling of the same
  // key is a build error (PNU2102); fix it by renaming or removing that key - never by deleting
  // or disabling the check, because the loader would otherwise read only the first one.
